! Test v1.08.3: RI-J with the heavy-element def2-universal-JFIT
! extension (K..Rn, shipped decontracted -- see the header of
! basis_data/def2-universal-jfit.dat for why).  Cu3 doublet
! PBE/LANL2DZ ECP, SAD, Fermi smearing 0.01.
! Expected (container reference):
!   [with %ri_check on]  dE_J ~ -4.9e-4 Ha at the SAD density
!   Total energy (F=E-TS):  -588.438494612200
!   vs conventional (%ri off): -588.437946904   -> dE(RI - exact)
!   = -5.5e-4 Ha (0.18 mHa/atom); Pt2 analogue: 14.5 uHa/atom.
%method  pbe
%basis   lanl2dz
%ecp     lanl2dz
%job     energy
%ecp_method   analytical
%initial_guess  sad
%scf_maxiter    300
%ri j
%smearing       fermi
%smearing_sigma 0.01
%charge 0
%mult   2
%geo
Cu   0.000000    1.360000    0.000000
Cu   1.177800   -0.680000    0.000000
Cu  -1.177800   -0.680000    0.000000
